      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WIN STAR (1) has progressed well this campaign and gets another good chance to keep the ball rolling. First look at this sort of trip, but Thompson is sure to give him another great look up on speed and should prove hard to run past. YOUR ATTITUDE (2) comes up the highway after showing plenty of grit to get off the mark over the Hawkesbury mile. Suspect the rise in distance won't bother him either, and he can give this a big shake. SO FORTUNATE (6) didn't give her maiden rivals a sniff at Grafton when leading all the way. Obviously tougher this time, but she's lightly raced and has plenty of scope to improve. Interesting to note the blinkers go on. MAY THE FORCE (5) meets WIN STAR with a good pull at the weights and is nice and fit. If she runs the trip and is not left with too much ground to bridge, she can turn the tables.",
